{"step_index":118,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T18:36:59Z","thinking":"The user requests to \"push that dialog with code\" to continue work on another machine. The immediate task is to populate the now-empty repository with the necessary files. The aim is to synchronize the current work state.\n\n\nIdentifying and extracting the specified dialogues and associated code is the primary focus. The objective is to assemble a complete, self-contained package facilitating seamless continuation on another system. This package will include cleaned Markdown transcripts of the dialogues, their raw JSONL equivalents for direct Antigravity restoration, the relevant code files, and a comprehensive README.md.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"& \"Y:\\market_replayer\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\" -c \"\nimport json, os\n\ndef export_transcript(conv_id, output_path, title):\n    src = os.path.expanduser(f'~/.gemini/antigravity/brain/{conv_id}/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl')\n    if not os.path.exists(src):\n        print(f'Not found: {src}')\n        return\n    with open(src, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        lines = [json.loads(line) for line in f if line.strip()]\n    \n    with open(output_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as out:\n        out.write(f'# {title}\\n\\n**Conversation ID:** `{conv_id}`\\n\\n---\\n\\n')\n        for item in lines:\n            src_type = item.get('type')\n            created_at = item.get('created_at', '')\n            content = item.get('content', '')\n            \n            if src_type == 'USER_INPUT':\n                # clean <USER_REQUEST> tags\n                text = content.replace('<USER_REQUEST>', '').replace('</USER_REQUEST>', '').strip()\n                out.write(f'### 👤 Пользователь ({created_at}):\\n\\n{text}\\n\\n---\\n\\n')\n            elif src_type == 'PLANNER_RESPONSE' and content:\n                out.write(f'### 🤖 Ассистент ({created_at}):\\n\\n{content.strip()}\\n\\n---\\n\\n')\n\nexport_transcript('1ef4b5d5-5029-4ef6-bbe2-268b460edeee', 'Y:/boltalka/dialog_1ef4b5d5_split_fractal.md', 'Диалог 1ef4b5d5: Разработка split_fractal, MACD и регрессия')\nexport_transcript('f8172bb1-cd41-412b-8d91-df43af3b7bf7', 'Y:/boltalka/dialog_current_signal.md', 'Текущий диалог: Создание проекта SIGNAL и канваса')\nprint('Transcripts exported successfully!')\n\"","Cwd":"Y:\\boltalka","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Exporting dialogue transcripts","toolSummary":"Export transcripts to markdown"}}]}
